# Path-level redirects, for a book that has moved between clusters.
#
# A slug is a URL. Moving a book changes its URL and every inbound link,
# so add a line here rather than accepting the breakage:
#
#   /old-domain/old-cluster/the-book/*  /new-domain/new-cluster/the-book/:splat  301
#
# Verify with `npx wrangler dev` — the only local server that applies this file.
